# takeoff.demo - throttle up, take off, climb, roll right and pull (PC scan codes: 4E throttle+, 50 down, 4D right)
theater MORNING
fps 60
key 0.2 down 4E
key 1.0 up 4E
key 13.5 down 50
key 14.3 up 50
key 20.0 down 4D
key 20.4 up 4D
key 20.4 down 50
key 20.9 up 50
